#95068
"Inside a Small Hut"
"Thick layers of ice line the wooden walls of this frost-filled hut, where the

air is so cold and humid it appears to be in a constant state of blizzard.  A

frozen oak door exits the hut to the north, and if there are any windows, they

are coated with such thick ice that they are no longer visible at all.  In

most of the corners of the hut, piles of bent and broken iron parts lie in

disheveled heaps.  A frost-covered rug rests in the center of the hut.

"
"reset1 is used to control the bar lock on the door

exit n is no.mob

room d is no.mob

"
